WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.234
-Thank you very, very much.

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:04.400
Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show"!

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.767
