[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:10.868
Thank you.
Let's get to some news, guys.

00:00:10.868 --> 00:00:12.934
Tonight, President Biden
attended a big

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:15.701
