"Putting it all on black."

00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:27.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.434
Anyway, long story short,

00:00:28.434 --> 00:00:30.000
Caesar's Palace
now owns Rhode Island.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.133
So, no big deal.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:32.601
No, it's all right.

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:33.701
Some more political news.

00:00:33.701 --> 00:00:35.634
Last night,
former president Trump

00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:37.701
