when the first question was,

00:00:59.501 --> 00:01:03.067
"Can we go home now?"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:04.667
Yep, Trump did a Q&amp;A.

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:05.834
He looked at the teleprompter,

00:01:05.834 --> 00:01:08.501
said, "Okay.
Now it's time for the Qanda."

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.601 --> 00:01:12.300
"Now it's time for the Qanda."

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:13.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.868 --> 00:01:17.067
"It's Q&amp;A."

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:19.267
"I love 'Black Panther.'
Qanda forever.

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:20.601
I've always said --"
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:20.601 --> 00:01:22.601
"I love Qanda.

00:01:22.601 --> 00:01:25.067
Some people celebrate Qanda,
some people don't."

00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:28.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:28.934 --> 00:01:30.734
"Q&amp;A."

00:01:30.734 --> 00:01:32.334
Meanwhile,
ahead of his speech in Iowa,

00:01:32.334 --> 00:01:34.400
Trump said that Florida governor
Ron DeSantis

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.667
