and high cholesterol.

00:01:42.834 --> 00:01:45.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:47.167
Yeah, and this made me laugh.

00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:49.467
When asked if he regretted
endorsing Ron DeSantis

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:52.534
