Trump said, and I quote...

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:57.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.834 --> 00:01:59.501
"Uh, yeah, maybe,
probably, yeah."

00:01:59.501 --> 00:02:01.434
And he didn't stop there.
He went onto say...

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:05.734
[ Laughter ]
Then he said...

00:02:08.801 --> 00:02:10.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:11.501
