00:02:16.701 --> 00:02:18.501
That's a direct quote.

00:02:18.501 --> 00:02:19.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:19.601 --> 00:02:20.734
Thank you, Roots.

00:02:20.734 --> 00:02:24.033
